// ---------- MULTI-TENANT: every query of a logged-in rep is pinned to HIS company ----------
// The bot talks to Supabase with the secret key (it bypasses RLS), so the isolation is forced here, in ONE place:
//  - GET / PATCH / DELETE on a company table get  &tenant_id=eq.<his company>
